%% Final path: deterministic verdict, cited evidence, optional grounded explanation
sequenceDiagram
  actor Citizen
  participant Chat as Web Chat
  participant API as POST /chat
  participant Rules as decide()
  participant Composer
  participant Verifier
  participant Language as LanguageService
  Citizen->>Chat: Submit final answer
  Chat->>API: Complete profile
  API->>Rules: Evaluate restricted expressions
  Rules-->>API: ELIGIBLE or NOT_ELIGIBLE + citations
  API->>Composer: Draft from the deciding citations
  Composer->>Verifier: Verify draft against same citations
  alt Unsupported claim
    Verifier-->>Composer: Recompose once or withhold answer
    Composer-->>API: Verified draft or honest fallback
  else Grounded
    Verifier-->>API: Verified draft
  end
  API->>Language: Localize explanation and plan speech
  Language-->>API: Localized text; verbatim citations remain unchanged
  API-->>Chat: Verdict, answer, citations
  Chat-->>Citizen: Show result and official evidence
